{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QpzBmCXQgLTA6yDmFt9LTF","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 struct_self_consist_ie 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (81 个)\\n\\n- **exp_002_ner_conll2003**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_004_re_diagnostic**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_005**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_014_entity_majority_voting**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_013_exact_match_voting**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp_012_logprob_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_005**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **e1_component_wise_re_sj**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_004**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **ft_002_v2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_002**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **ft_002**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **ft_001**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_003**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_019_supervised_verifier（等待人工审批）\\n- exp_017_llama_conll_n16_s456_r1024（准备中）\\n- exp_017_llama_conll_n16_r1024（准备中）\\n- exp_001_n16_seed123_full（准备中）\\n- exp_001_n16_seed456_full（准备中）\\n- exp001_seed123（准备中）\\n- exp001_seed456（准备中）\\n- exp_007_ner_llama（准备中）\\n- exp_002_merge_conll2003（准备中）\\n- exp008_re_n16（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp_freeform_ablation** (negative): —\\n  [freeform_ablation_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/exp_freeform_ablation/report/freeform_ablation_results.md)\\n- **exp_018_llama_scierc_seed456** (killed): —\\n- **exp_018_llama_scierc_seed42_r1024** (success): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 42 / 负向 19 / 失败 1 / 共 71\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\n\\n## 告警\\n- ft_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- mvp_pilot_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp_008_re_n16_full: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_001_seed42_v2_r1024: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_001_seed123_v2_r1024: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp_001_seed456_v2_ner_r1024: 已被终止 — unknown