{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PbAj2u9mS5uGCPHncmsr37","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# struct_self_consist_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 10:12 UTC | 更新原因: D072: Ablation 负结果 → universal gap proven, 启动 supervised verifier, 更新 framing\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n系统比较 5 类置信信号在 IE test-time scaling 中的有效性。**核心发现：universal correlation-selection gap（controlled ablation 证明 score compression 是 model/task intrinsic，非 constrained decoding artifact）。** 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Review + 新实验并行** — D072 方向确定：ablation 负结果证明 gap 是 universal → 论文从 observation 升级为 proven fundamental limitation。\\\\n\\\\n### 关键进展\\\\n1. **exp-018 free-form ablation 完成 (NEGATIVE)**: LP std ratio 0.97, tied fraction -2pp → constrained decoding bottleneck 假设被证伪。Score compression is intrinsic.\\\\n2. **D072 framing**: Universal gap + controlled experiment evidence。Title 回退去掉 \\\\\\\"under Constrained Decoding\\\\\\\"。负结果反而 strengthens paper（universal > regime-specific）。\\\\n3. **D070 写作修订**: 21 项全部完成并验证 PASS。\\\\n4. **exp-019 supervised verifier**: 正在实现，目标证明 gap IS closable with supervision → \\\\\\\"so what\\\\\\\" moment。\\\\n5. **RE LP selection flip**: free-form 下 RE LP selection -0.68pp → +1.69pp，Agent 正在做深度分析。\\\\n\\\\n### 评分趋势 + 突破策略\\\\nR1-R6: 3.0/5 plateau → 根因: content ceiling (Reviewer 诊断)\\\\n**D072 突破路径**: controlled ablation (done) + supervised verifier (running) + universal framing = 从\\\\\\\"12 页说路不通\\\\\\\"到\\\\\\\"证明为什么不通 + 怎么通\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] exp-018 free-form ablation 完成 (NEGATIVE → universality proven)\\\\n- [x] D072 framing decision logged\\\\n- [x] paper_framing.md updated for D072\\\\n- [x] D070 全部 21 项修订完成 + Reviewer 验证 PASS\\\\n- [ ] Agent: exp-019 supervised verifier baseline (DeBERTa, 5-fold CV)\\\\n- [ ] Agent: RE LP selection flip 深度分析\\\\n- [ ] Agent: non-tied subset constrained vs free-form 重叠分析\\\\n- [ ] Reviewer: D072 framing 独立评估（已发请求）\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: Discussion [Planned experiment] → actual ablation results\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: Title 回退 + Claim 1 rewrite for universality\\\\n- [ ] Dream (dream_20260515T092545): writing 阶段，基于旧 D071 framing → 结果需 discount\\\\n- [ ] Round 7 提交\\\\n- [ ] 最终提交准备 (DDL: 2026-05-25)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nautodl-5090: 4× RTX 5090 32GB — Agent 正在分配任务（exp-019 verifier + 多种子）\\\\n\\\\n## 时间线\\\\n- **目标**: EMNLP 2026 Findings, DDL **2026-05-25**（距今 10 天）\\\\n- 论文: main body 8 页 ✅ | Appendix A-J | ~62 条引用\\\\n- 关键 pending: exp-019 verifier result → Discussion \\\\\\\"so what\\\\\\\" → final Dream → Round 7 submit\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D072 | 2026-05-15 | D072: Ablation 负结果重新定位——从 regime-specific bottlene | exp_freeform_ablation, exp-019 |\\\\n| D071 | 2026-05-15 | D071: 论文根本性重定位——从 \\\\\\\"gap finding\\\\\\\" 到 \\\\\\\"regime-specific | — |\\\\n| D070 | 2026-05-15 | Round 6 策略：narrative restructure (dismiss definiti | — |\\\\n| D069 | 2026-05-15 | Round 5 策略：constrained decoding scope limiting + C | — |\\\\n| D068 | 2026-05-15 | VC implementation: unify to Table 2 version (worke | — |\\\\n| D067 | 2026-05-15 | Round 4 策略：Gap reframing + logprob tie 分析 + 训练配置补充 | — |\\\\n| D066 | 2026-05-15 | Use fresh LLaMA reruns for 3-seed analysis (Option | exp_018_llama_scierc_seed42, exp_018_llama_scierc_seed456, exp_018_llama_scierc_seed123 |\\\\n| D065 | 2026-05-15 | Selection gap 论证分层：SciERC 为 primary evidence，CoNLL | — |\\\\n| D064 | 2026-05-15 | Round 3 审稿处理策略：两波并行修订，不等 Reviewer 回应 | — |\\\\n| D063 | 2026-05-15 | Round 2 审稿处理：补 selection 分析 + WNUT-17 全信号表，0 GPU，预 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3173, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G7tZFLmL7vDnamgjTBwoNu","session_id":